     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"With h1_0:reach and h3_2:escalate blocked, the target cannot be reached. Every route to crown:obtain goes through one of the blocked steps. (1) h4_2:reach and h4_3:reach each depend only on h3_2:escalate, which is blocked, so neither is reachable. (2) h4_1:escalate is an AND step needing both h3_3:escalate and h2_2:access. h3_3 is reachable via edge0, h1_1 and h2_0. But h2_2:access is an AND step that requires h1_0:reach, which is blocked, so h2_2 and therefore h4_1 are unreachable. Since none of crown:obtain's OR parents can be reached, the target is not reachable.\"}"
